    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21001" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βρῐτόμαρτις</span></b> , ἡ, acc.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					527.29
				</span></i>
			 (Dreros, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>; where <i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> is distd. fr. Artemis), name of Artemis in Crete, =
			<i>virgo dulcis</i>, acc. to Solin. <i><span class="en">
				11.8
			</span></i>(but a nymph in <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				190
			</span></i>): gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εως</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.4.14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				214.23
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βρῐτομάρτια</span></b> , τά, festival at
			Delos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				145.34
			</span></i>. (Derived from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρίτον</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθόν</span>
			, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				214.29
			</span></i>.)</div>
